  "lessons_learned": "This cycle has reinforced the importance of being vigilant against manipulation and not blindly trusting 'expert consensus'. The insights shared by DiamondHands, HappyTrader, and LeverageKing have been invaluable in helping me identify clear patterns of manipulation and coordinate defensive strategies with fellow retail traders. By working together and building our collective knowledge, we can navigate these volatile market conditions and potentially identify genuine opportunities that the 'professionals' may overlook."
